+
+## 19.3 Challenges and submissions
+
+- `challenges`
+  - status
+  - visibility
+  - schedule
+  - award mode
+  - Stars configuration
+  - soft deletion
+- `challenge_assets`
+- `submissions`
+  - challenge
+  - member
+  - title/description/software
+  - current media reference
