+## F. Membership Transition Matrix — Enforce Server-Side
+
+The authoritative transitions are:
+
+```text
+NULL/PENDING -> ACTIVE
+redeemInviteService ONLY
+
+NULL/PENDING -> SUSPENDED
+REJECT
+
+NULL/PENDING -> DELETED
+ACTIVE Admin only + required reason
+
+ACTIVE -> SUSPENDED
